### Requests for the IntelliJ / VS Code REST client. Start the app with the demo profile first.
@base = http://localhost:8080/api/v1/prices

### Publish a price
POST {{base}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "vendorId": "BLOOMBERG",
  "instrumentId": "AAPL",
  "bid": 190.00,
  "ask": 190.10,
  "currency": "USD",
  "timestamp": "{{$isoTimestamp}}"
}


### All prices from a vendor
GET {{base}}/vendors/BLOOMBERG

### All vendors' prices for an instrument
GET {{base}}/instruments/AAPL

### Health
GET http://localhost:8080/actuator/health
